00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.950
But there's nothing here.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:58.950
Nothing.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.950
We can look then.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:01.950
But why?

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.950
A telephone call.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.950
A telephone call about some paintings.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:06.950
From?

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:07.950
We don't know.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:08.950
You don't know?

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:09.950
Well...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:10.950
The main inspector.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.950
The paintings are up here.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:13.950
I can show you.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.000
Follow me.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.950
It's ten minutes later.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.950
The man and the woman are in the police cars.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.950
Well, Eddie.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:23.950
This is a surprise.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:24.950
Eddie.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.950
Is that my name?

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:27.950
Eddie.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:28.950
Come on.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.950
No, I can't remember.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.950
You can't remember me.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.950
I can't remember my name.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:35.950
Eddie.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:36.950
Eddie, what?

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.950
Eddie Hampton.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:41.950
What are you doing here, Eddie?

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:42.950
I tell him.

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:45.950
I tell him about the field and the binoculars.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.950
I tell him about the bump on my head and the room.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.950
I tell him about the paper and the key.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.950
He's laughing at me.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.950
Okay.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.950
I'm Eddie Hampton, but who's Eddie Hampton?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.000
He's laughing again.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:04.950
You know me.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.950
Am I a policeman?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.950
No, Eddie.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.950
You aren't a policeman.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:10.950
Then who am I?

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.950
And what am I doing here?

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.950
I don't know.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.950
But I can't tell you something.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:17.950
What?

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.950
Eddie Hampton's a criminal.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.950
A thief.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.950
Not a big thief.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:27.950
Those two people are big thieves with their famous paintings.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:28.950
No.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.950
You're a small thief, Eddie.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:38.950
You steal from houses, televisions, radios, videos, high-fives, a little money sometimes.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:43.000
You're a small, but thank you for your help.

